[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2429733\">7210E18</a></p><p>1. Unscrew the hinge retaining bolts.</p><p>2. Remove the hinge (2a) and collect any shims (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045121.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Refit the hinge.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>It will be decided whether to\nuse shims when adjusting and centring the door.</p></aside><p>Screw in the bolts without tightening.</p>"]]